	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="A Model of Balance as Production in Colombia Designed to Support Exploration in the Yukon" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9592" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/a-model-of-balance-as-production-in-colombia-designed-to-support-exploration-in-the-yukon/2025-mining-issue-forge-resources_blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/2025-Mining-Issue-Forge-Resources_Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="2025 Mining Issue-Forge Resources_Blog Header" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Forge Resources blog header image&lt;/p&gt;
