	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/clean-energy-from-an-unlikely-source-catches-on-across-north-america/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Clean Energy From an Unlikely Source Catches on Across North America" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9563" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/clean-energy-from-an-unlikely-source-catches-on-across-north-america/sharc-international-systems-blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/SHARC-International-Systems-Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="SHARC International Systems- Blog Header" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Sharc International Blog Header Imagery&lt;/p&gt;
